      "source": "JYP ENTERTAINMENT / Stray Kids Official",
      "title": "Stray Kids Drop New Single 'Ceremony' Ahead of World Tour!",
      "excerpt": "Title track from the album 'KARMA'. Concept films and stadium tour dates inside.",
      "quote": "STAY, make some noise — 'Ceremony' is here!",
      "image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/P7vBoGWoReg/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Stray Kids have officially kicked off their latest comeback with the single 'Ceremony', the title track of their album 'KARMA', with concept films dropping daily across official channels.",
        "JYP ENTERTAINMENT confirms the track was self-produced by 3RACHA (Bang Chan, Changbin, Han), with a music video filmed across Seoul and Los Angeles.",
        "The single arrives ahead of the dominATE stadium world tour, where STAY will hear it live for the first time.",
        "Pre-save links are open now on all major streaming platforms."
      ]
    }
